WEBVTT

00:00:00.133 --> 00:00:00.633
Okay!

00:00:00.633 --> 00:00:03.100
Which one does NOT belong?

00:00:08.467 --> 00:00:09.533
TIME'S UP!

00:00:09.967 --> 00:00:11.367
The answer is...

00:00:11.367 --> 00:00:11.833
A,

00:00:11.833 --> 00:00:12.300
boat!

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:13.267
A car,

00:00:13.267 --> 00:00:13.733
bus,

00:00:13.733 --> 00:00:16.067
and truck travel on roads.

00:00:16.067 --> 00:00:18.433
A boat travels on water,

00:00:18.433 --> 00:00:20.767
so it does not belong.

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:22.167
Here's one,

00:00:22.167 --> 00:00:23.433
a picture puzzle!

00:00:23.433 --> 00:00:26.033
Where does the dot move next?

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:32.467
TIME'S UP!

00:00:32.900 --> 00:00:34.367
The answer is...

00:00:34.367 --> 00:00:34.867
A,

00:00:34.867 --> 00:00:35.367
bottom-left!

00:00:35.367 --> 00:00:37.333
The dot steps counter-clockwise

00:00:37.333 --> 00:00:38.833
around the corners,

00:00:38.833 --> 00:00:41.767
so the next spot is bottom-left.

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:43.467
Here's one,

00:00:43.467 --> 00:00:45.233
a number series!

00:00:45.233 --> 00:00:45.833
Three,

00:00:45.833 --> 00:00:46.400
four,

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:47.000
six,

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:47.567
nine,

00:00:47.567 --> 00:00:48.167
thirteen,

00:00:48.167 --> 00:00:49.333
and then...

00:00:49.333 --> 00:00:51.100
what comes next?

00:00:56.500 --> 00:00:57.567
TIME'S UP!

00:00:58.000 --> 00:00:59.233
The answer is...

00:00:59.233 --> 00:00:59.633
B,

00:00:59.633 --> 00:01:00.033
eighteen!

00:01:00.033 --> 00:01:02.500
The gaps grow by the same

00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:03.700
amount each step,

00:01:03.700 --> 00:01:06.167
so the next number is eighteen.

00:01:06.667 --> 00:01:07.033
So,

00:01:07.033 --> 00:01:08.833
are you smart or fart?

00:01:08.833 --> 00:01:11.033
Count up your correct answers to

00:01:11.033 --> 00:01:12.100
find your rank!

00:01:12.633 --> 00:01:12.933
So,

00:01:12.933 --> 00:01:14.167
how did you do?

00:01:14.167 --> 00:01:15.400
Comment your score below,

00:01:15.400 --> 00:01:16.633
and follow for more!
